{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And it shall be.</b> This is a miraculous act, for this soot, which is small in quantity, became dust over all the land of Egypt, and it did not separate Israel." "<b>Boils breaking out.</b> The alef is added, for it is from the root of מים תבעה אש (Isaiah 64:1), and the word is doubled, like תשעשעו (ibid. 66:12), תשגשגי (ibid. 17:11)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:53.676490682Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}